    ]
  },
  "StockRole": "Juggernaut",
  "YangsThoughts": "The Menace is one of the heavier Clan Superheavy OmniMechs, weighing in at 185 tons. Based on an Endo Steel chassis with a 350 XL engine, the chassis is not particularly fast or agile, but it makes up for it with its general offensive package. All configurations of the Menace are heavily focused on offensive firepower at range, often used as a long range option when firepower matters more than survival. To ensure it has enough cooling it uses the volataile Prototype heat sinks, meaning any internal critical hits can turn deadly, but an acceptable risk considering its large offensive arsenal.",
